---
source: crates/cache-explorer-core/tests/golden.rs
description: "The design's flow B on two-way-lru: 0x000 and 0x040 fill set 0, a hit makes way 0 the most recent, then 0x080 evicts way 1 (victim row 4.3) and 0x0C0 evicts way 0 (cases 2, 1 and 3)."
---
1.1 | decode | lineSize | - | - | Load 0x000: tag 0x00, set 0, offset 0 (word 0).
1.2 | miss | associativity | accesses, loads, misses, compulsory | - | Set 0: no valid way holds tag 0x00. Miss.
1.3 | victim | associativity | - | - | Way 0 chosen: it is invalid (empty).
1.4 | fill | lineSize | valid 0/0, tag 0/0, word 0/0/0, word 0/0/1, word 0/0/2, word 0/0/3, fills | - | Fill way 0 with line 0x000–0x00F from memory.
1.5 | complete | - | r1 | - | Read word 0 of way 0 (5) into r1.
2.1 | decode | lineSize | - | - | Load 0x040: tag 0x01, set 0, offset 0 (word 0).
2.2 | miss | associativity | accesses, loads, misses, compulsory | - | Set 0: no valid way holds tag 0x01. Miss.
2.3 | victim | associativity | - | - | Way 1 chosen: it is invalid (empty).
2.4 | fill | lineSize | valid 0/1, tag 0/1, word 0/1/0, word 0/1/1, word 0/1/2, word 0/1/3, fills | - | Fill way 1 with line 0x040–0x04F from memory.
2.5 | complete | - | r1 | - | Read word 0 of way 1 (19) into r1.
2.6 | rank | replacement | rank 0/0, rank 0/1 | - | LRU ranks in set 0: way 1 becomes 0 (most recent); way 0 is 1.
3.1 | decode | lineSize | - | - | Load 0x000: tag 0x00, set 0, offset 0 (word 0).
3.2 | hit | associativity | accesses, loads, hits | - | Set 0, way 0: valid, and tag 0x00 matches. Hit.
3.3 | complete | - | r1 | - | Read word 0 of way 0 (5) into r1.
3.4 | rank | replacement | rank 0/0, rank 0/1 | - | LRU ranks in set 0: way 0 becomes 0 (most recent); way 1 is 1.
4.1 | decode | lineSize | - | - | Load 0x080: tag 0x02, set 0, offset 0 (word 0).
4.2 | miss | associativity | accesses, loads, misses, compulsory | - | Set 0: no valid way holds tag 0x02. Miss.
4.3 | victim | replacement | - | - | Way 1 chosen: least recently used (rank 1).
4.4 | evict | replacement | valid 0/1, tag 0/1, word 0/1/0, word 0/1/1, word 0/1/2, word 0/1/3, evictions | - | Evict line 0x040 (tag 0x01) from way 1.
4.5 | fill | lineSize | valid 0/1, tag 0/1, word 0/1/0, word 0/1/1, word 0/1/2, word 0/1/3, fills | - | Fill way 1 with line 0x080–0x08F from memory.
4.6 | complete | - | r1 | - | Read word 0 of way 1 (33) into r1.
4.7 | rank | replacement | rank 0/0, rank 0/1 | - | LRU ranks in set 0: way 1 becomes 0 (most recent); way 0 is 1.
5.1 | decode | lineSize | - | - | Load 0x0C0: tag 0x03, set 0, offset 0 (word 0).
5.2 | miss | associativity | accesses, loads, misses, compulsory | - | Set 0: no valid way holds tag 0x03. Miss.
5.3 | victim | replacement | - | - | Way 0 chosen: least recently used (rank 1).
5.4 | evict | replacement | valid 0/0, tag 0/0, word 0/0/0, word 0/0/1, word 0/0/2, word 0/0/3, evictions | - | Evict line 0x000 (tag 0x00) from way 0.
5.5 | fill | lineSize | valid 0/0, tag 0/0, word 0/0/0, word 0/0/1, word 0/0/2, word 0/0/3, fills | - | Fill way 0 with line 0x0C0–0x0CF from memory.
5.6 | complete | - | r1 | - | Read word 0 of way 0 (47) into r1.
5.7 | rank | replacement | rank 0/0, rank 0/1 | - | LRU ranks in set 0: way 0 becomes 0 (most recent); way 1 is 1.
